      {
        "id": 199914,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-08T18:20:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Some additions to what grysqrl said:</p><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Shadows Flicker Like Flame</strong> is also about&nbsp;<em>utility/control</em>. Its ability to target any land with Dahan on the board can be extremely useful, if you remember to save up the Energy. And don't underestimate its ability to manipulate the invaders.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Serpent Slumbering Beneath the Island</strong>&nbsp;is also about <i>slow growth.</i> Early on it will be helping other spirits, but when it fully rouses in anger... Other Spirits are also slow growing, but it is the most extreme.</li>\n</ul>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:28:06.032Z",
